{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20712","headline":"示添丁 · 卢仝","name":"示添丁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春风苦不仁，呼逐马蹄行人家。\n惭愧瘴气却怜我，入我憔悴骨中爲生涯。\n数日不食强强行，何忍索我抱看满树花。\n不知四体正困𢞎，泥人啼哭声呀呀\n忽来案上翻墨汁，涂抹诗书如老鵶。\n父怜母惜掴不得，却生痴笑令人嗟。\n宿舂连晓不成米，日高始进一椀茶。\n气力龙锺头欲白，凭仗添丁莫恼爷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20712.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20712","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}